OL,3,GNEWSATwo men arrested after
OL,4,ANewtownabbey stabbing released on bail
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men arrested following the stabbing
OL,7,Fof a man in Newtownabbey have been
OL,8,Freleased on bail.
OL,10,FPolice were called to Glenville Park at
OL,11,Faround 08:25 BST on Saturday and the
OL,12,Finjured man was taken to hospital.
OL,14,FA 32-year-old man who was arrested in
OL,15,Fconnection with the incident has been
OL,16,Freleased on bail to allow for further
OL,17,Fpolice enquiries.
OL,19,FA 58-year-old man, who was also
OL,20,Farrested, has been released
OL,21,Funconditionally.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
